{"id":"a8528bdacedf47a3","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-valid.md","title":"Valid (Logically True)","display":"df-valid — Valid (Logically True)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-valid","aliases":["92-df-valid","92-df-tautology"],"display":"df-valid — Valid (Logically True)","depends_on":["[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-valid"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-valid</span><span>92-df-tautology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-valid — Valid (Logically True)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid} \\vdash \\mathrm{Valid}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid} \\vdash \\mathrm{Valid}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有效：在所有模型中为真</li>\n<li>也称永真式、逻辑真理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models \\varphi\">\\(\\models \\varphi\\)</span>（无前件）</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\lor \\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi \\lor \\neg\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(x = x)\">\\(\\forall x(x = x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>对固定的纯一阶逻辑演算，完备性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\varphi\">\\(\\models_G\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\vdash_{\\mathrm{FOL}}\\varphi\\)</span>，可靠性给出逆向蕴含</li>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_G\\)</span> 量化所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言结构；带非逻辑算术公理的系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 所证明的公式不必在所有这些结构中有效</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_G$ (structure class, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}_G$ (assignment constructor, see [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Valid}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid} \\vdash \\mathrm{Valid}_G(\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow \\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\lor \\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"t